# Private venue artifacts (EXEC SPINE R-1 shape capture).
# `docs/evidence/venue/polymarket_us/` is GIT-TRACKED (135 files), and the
# smoke script's leak check (`find_secret_leak_offsets`) scans ONLY for supplied
# credential strings — it cannot see a balance or a position. Anything derived
# from an authenticated private endpoint must carry the PRIVATE_ prefix so it
# can never be added by a bare `git add docs/`.
docs/evidence/venue/**/PRIVATE_*
